FAO, with support from @AfDB_Group, launched the 2026 rice planting season at #AweilRiceScheme.

This year, more than 3 000 feddans of farmland are targeted for cultivation to boost local rice production &amp; improve #FoodSecurity for communities across South Sudan 🌱🍚

